## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design a privacy-preserving, multi-tenant AI workflow at scale, with strict data isolation, governance, and measurable latency.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant OpenAI deployment and prompt routing
- Real-time ingestion (Event Hubs) and low-latency scoring
- KB grounding via Cognitive Search on Blob data
- PII redaction (Text Analytics) and per-tenant masking (Key Vault)
- RBAC (Azure AD), Data Lake auditing, canary rollout

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: route prompt for tenant, redact, ground, respond
async function handleRequest(req){
  const tenantId = req.headers['x-tenant'];
  const raw = req.body;
  const redacted = redactPII(raw);
  const kb = loadKBVersion(tenantId);
  const prompt = buildPrompt(redacted, kb, tenantId);
  const resp = await openai.complete(prompt, {deployment: getDeployment(tenantId)});
  logAudit(tenantId, prompt, resp);
  return resp;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How to quantify latency vs. isolation trade-offs?
- How to implement drift detection for the KB and prompts across tenants?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design policy-grounded assistants with explainable outputs and integrated escalation.

## Key Concepts
- Grounding with Cognitive Search embeddings
- Confidence scoring and provenance tracking
- Safe escalation to ticketing (ServiceNow)
- Data lineage and logging for audits

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: compute final answer with grounding and provenance
async function answer(query) {
  const docs = await searchKB(query);
  const prompt = buildPrompt(query, docs);
  const res = await openai.complete({ prompt });
  const provenance = docs.map(d => d.id);
  const confidence = res.meta?.confidence ?? 0.9;
  if (confidence < 0.8) await ticketSystem.create('Review needed', { query, provenance });
  return { text: res.text, confidence, provenance };
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle KB versioning and rollback?
- How would you validate calibration of confidence scores in production?

